<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<!-- $title = SORTED FUTURES.txt -->
<!-- @import '../head.kit' -->

<body class="">
    <!-- @import '../header.kit' -->
    <div class="main">
        <div class="project-intro typewriter">
            <div class="project-intro-inner">
                <h1 class="project-title" data-chars="1" data-speed="50">Sorted Futures</h1>
                <hr>
                <div class="project-details-wrapper">
                    <div class="project-details">
                        <h2>Client</h2>
                        <p>Sorted Futures</p>
                        <h2>Involvement</h2>
                        <p>Campaign Development</p>
                        <p>Photoshoot Creative Direction</p>
                        <p>Photomanipulation and Compositing</p>
                        <p>Signage</p>
                        <p>Social Media Content </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Challenge</h2>
                        <p>Founded by two ex-cops with a passion for scuba diving and a desire to make meaningful change in the lives of Indigenous kids from remote communities, Sorted Futures offers high school students the opportunity to earn diving qualifications and an introduction to a professional field that they would not have otherwise been introduced to. The skills and commitment required to achieve diving accreditation has been shown to significantly improve health, social and education outcomes for the children that undertake it.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="project-description">
                        <h2>Solution</h2>
                        <p>I created a brand for Sorted Futures that has taken them from a side-project for two friends — to a full-time not-for-profit organisation. </p>
                        <p>Sorted Futures was conceived as a youth adventure brand rather than a charity. It is a brand designed, primarily, to engage teenagers while giving education providers and corporations a way to support young people in a way that creates real, tangible, positive outcomes.</p>
                        <div class="collab-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                            <img alt="Cameron Murray" title="Cameron Murray" src="/assets/logo-cameron-murray.svg">
                            <img alt="Block Branding" title="Block Branding" src="/assets/logo-block.svg">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-content">
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-1.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-2.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-3.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-4.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-5.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-6.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-7.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-8.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-9.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-10.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-11.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-13.webp"></div>
            <div class="expandable"><img src="images/sorted-futures-15.webp"></div>
            <div class="two-col">
                <img src="images/sorted-futures-outcome-1.webp">
                <img src="images/sorted-futures-outcome-2.webp">
            </div>
        </div>
